│ 1. **Specific Actions to Remediate the Gap:**                                │
│    - Immediately change all default passwords on network devices to strong,  │
│ unique passwords.                                                            │
│    - Implement a password management policy requiring all users to create    │
│ and manage complex passwords.                                                │
│    - Ensure that default credentials are removed from device documentation   │
