│ 2. **Feasibility Assessment:**                                               │
│    - **Cost:** Low to moderate; involves updating existing configurations    │
│ and training staff on new policies.                                          │
│    - **Timeline:** Immediate action is recommended, with a completion goal   │
│ within two weeks for all devices.                                            │
│    - **Disruption:** Minimal disruption if planned carefully, especially     │
│ during maintenance windows.                                                  │
│    - **Capability:** Requires technical expertise in network device          │
│ management and user training.                                                │
│                                                                              │
│ 3. **Practical Considerations:**                                             │
│    - Ensure that new passwords are securely stored and accessible only to    │
│ authorized personnel.                                                        │
│    - Regularly audit password policies and enforce compliance through        │
